Third-party components

This package's dist/native/goxslt-*.{dylib,so,dll} is a native shared-library
build of the engine from github.com/tim-riep/go-xslt (Apache-2.0, Copyright
2026 Tim Riep), which in turn depends on golang.org/x/text (BSD-3-Clause).
At runtime it is loaded via the koffi FFI library (MIT, Copyright 2026 Niels
Martignène), an ordinary npm dependency (see package.json).

